fa-check\"></i> Balms/Liniments</li>\n          <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Lotions</li>\n          <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Shampoos</li>\n          <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Soaps</li>\n          <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Powders</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>        \n       </div>\n               <a href=\"#contract-enquiry-form\" class=\"btn\">ENQUIRE NOW</a>    \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .launch-brand-section .section-wrapper {\n    background-color: #1e392a;\n    background-image: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0925/8998/1983/files/background-image-1-1.webp?v=1750749678'); /* Replace with your background */\n    background-repeat: no-repeat;\n    background-position: center;\n    background-size: cover;\n    padding: 40px 20px;\n    color: #fff;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    max-width: 86%;\n    margin: 30px auto;\n  }\n\n  .launch-brand-section h2 {\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 30px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-family: \"Canto\";\n}\n\n  .launch-brand-section p {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #ccc;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto 40px auto;\n  }\n\n  .launch-brand-section .row {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 30px;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n    margin-left: 7%;\n    margin-right: 7%;\n  \n  }\n  \n  .content-boxul {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 30px;\n  \n  }\n\n  .launch-brand-section .content-box,\n  .launch-brand-section .image-box {\n    flex: 1 1 48%;\n  }\n\n  .launch-brand-section .content-box h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    position: relative;\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 39px;\n  }\n\n  .launch-brand-section .content-box h3::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    background-image: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0925/8998/1983/files/after-line.svg');\n    background-size: contain;\n    background-repeat: no-repeat;\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 20px;\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 1px;\n    left: 100%;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n   \n  }\n\n  .launch-brand-section .content-box ul {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding-left: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .launch-brand-section .content-box ul li {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n\n  .launch-brand-section .content-box ul li i {\n    color: #b7da7a;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .launch-brand-section .btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    background-color: #f6a622;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n    transition: 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .launch-brand-section .btn:hover {\n    background-color: #d88f0a;\n  }\n\n  .launch-brand-section .image-box img {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  /* Responsive */\n  @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n    .launch-brand-section .row {\n      flex-direction: column;\n      \n    }\n\n    .launch-brand-section .content-box,\n    .launch-brand-section .image-box {\n      flex: 1 1 100%;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .launch-brand-section h2 {\n      font-size: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .launch-brand-section .content-box h3 {\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .launch-brand-section .btn {\n      width: 100%;\n      text-align: center;\n      \n    }\n  .content-boxul {\n      flex-direction: raw;\n  \n  }    \n    \n  }\n</style>\n\n<!-- FontAwesome -->\n<link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">"
