      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"why-kairali-cards\">\n  <div class=\"why-kairali-grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"why-card\">\n      <div class=\"icon-box\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0925/8998/1983/files/icon-1.png\" alt=\"Icon 1\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-content\">\n        <h3>Commitment to Partnership</h3>\n        <p>Your success is our priority. We view our relationship with clients as a long-term partnership, offering transparency, reliability and innovation to ensure our partners thrive alongside us.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"why-card\">\n      <div class=\"icon-box\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0925/8998/1983/files/icon-2.png\" alt=\"Icon 2\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-content\">\n        <h3>Cost Effectiveness</h3>\n        <p>Partnering with us gives you access to cost-effective solutions without compromising quality. We help you achieve business goals efficiently and affordably.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"why-card\">\n      <div class=\"icon-box\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0925/8998/1983/files/icon-3.png\" alt=\"Icon 3\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-content\">\n        <h3>Quality Assurance</h3>\n        <p>Our quality control is unmatched. We ensure premium Ayurvedic solutions through stringent processes, offering effective and reliable products every time.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"why-card\">\n      <div class=\"icon-box\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0925/8998/1983/files/icon-4.png\" alt=\"Icon 4\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-content\">\n        <h3>State of the Art Facilities</h3>\n        <p>Our modern manufacturing plants uphold the highest standards, ensuring each Ayurvedic product reflects purity, quality and innovation.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"why-card\">\n      <div class=\"icon-box\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0925/8998/1983/files/icon-5.png\" alt=\"Icon 5\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-content\">\n        <h3>Customizable Packaging Support</h3>\n        <p>We provide expert assistance to design standout packaging that reflects your brand and resonates with consumers across markets.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"why-card\">\n      <div class=\"icon-box\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0925/8998/1983/files/icon-6.png\" alt=\"Icon 6\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-content\">\n        <h3>Flexibility and Adaptability</h3>\n        <p>With agile processes, we quickly adapt to your evolving needs, whether it's demand, timelines, or specifications — ensuring speed and customization.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.why-kairali-cards {\n  padding: 60px 20px;\n}\n\n.why-kairali-grid {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n  gap: 40px;\n}\n\n.why-card {\n  position: relative;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 2px solid #8d9c33;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  padding: 60px 20px 30px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.icon-box {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -30px;\n  left: 50%;\n  transform: translateX(-50%);\n  background-color: #8d9c33;\n  padding: 15px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  width: 100px;\n  height: 100px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.icon-box img {\n  width: 100px;\n  height: 100px;\n  filter: brightness(0) invert(1);\n}\n\n.card-content h3 {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  color: #1c1c1c;\n}\n\n.card-content p {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #444;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  padding: 0 10px;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .icon-box {\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    padding: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .icon-box img {\n    width: 80px;\n    height: 80px;\n  }\n\n  .why-card {\n    padding: 50px 16px 24px;\n  }\n}\n</style>"
      }
    },
