        "collapsible_tab_Dx7nhx": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are the products from kairali safe to use?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, the products from Kairali are absolutely safe to use as they are incorporated with natural ingredients and undergo strict quality control measures. </p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "question_mark"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_xXATwn": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do kairali ayurvedic products ensure the quality of their products?",
            "content": "<p>From the procurement of natural ingredients to the ultimate packaging of the product, Kairali Ayurvedic Contract Manufacturing adheres to stringent quality control procedures. To guarantee the effectiveness and security of their Ayurvedic remedies, they also carry out routine testing and quality inspections. </p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "question_mark"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_WnmY4k": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the benefits of using kairali ayurvedic products?",
            "content": "<p>Kairali ayurvedic third party manufacturing company produces natural ayurvedic medications that offer several health advantages basis the kind of products being used. </p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "question_mark"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_xBMrhF": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the manufacturing process followed by kairali ayurvedic products?",
            "content": "<p>In order to develop a powerful herbal composition, Kairali Ayurvedic Products uses natural ingredients that are ground into a fine powder and combined with other herbs and oils, following a traditional Ayurvedic manufacturing procedure. </p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "question_mark"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_QerViB": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the minimum order quantity (MOQ) for contract manufacturing with kairali?",
            "content": "<p>The MOQ may vary depending on the type of product and customization requirements. Kairali works closely with clients to determine suitable MOQs based on their specific needs and production capabilities. </p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "question_mark"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_bGYB68": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is kairali ayurvedic products a reliable ayurvedic company in India?",
            "content": "<p>Kairali Ayurvedic Products is a 100% reliable contract manufacturing company in India serving for more than 8 decades. We have more than 300 products & expanding and 25 centres worldwide that uses natural ingredients and adheres to strict quality control measures. </p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "question_mark"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_UbJrye": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How can I get started with contract manufacturing services from kairali?",
            "content": "<p>To get started, simply contact Kairali Ayurvedic Product, top herbal contract manufacturers in India through their website www.kairaliproducts.in or customer service on +91-9555156156 to discuss your project requirements and explore partnership opportunities.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "question_mark"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_wATQxy": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does kairali contract manufacturing offer private label services?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Kairali- Ayurvedic Third Party Manufacturing Services provides private label services, allowing clients to brand products with their own labels and packaging designs. </p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "question_mark"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_8FVazw": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What quality control measures does kairali contract manufacturing implement?",
            "content": "<p>Kairali Contract Manufacturing adheres to stringent quality control measures throughout the manufacturing process, including sourcing of raw materials, production, testing, and packaging, to ensure the highest quality standards are maintained. </p>",
            "page": "",
